title: hollow_moon_start
tags: moon
---
Scanning reveals this moon is hollow. It's a shell built around a massive, dormant engine. It looks like the Vanguard tried to turn this moon into a ship. #line:hollow_moon_start_00
-> Enter Core #line:hollow_moon_start_01
    <<jump hollow_moon_engine_choice>>
-> Mine Shell #line:hollow_moon_start_02
    <<give_credits 400>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: hollow_moon_engine_choice
tags: 
---
The engine is intact but requires a Strange Matter spark to start. If you start it, the moon might leave orbit... or explode. #line:hollow_moon_engine_choice_00
-> Ignite Engine #line:hollow_moon_engine_choice_01
    <<reveal_clue rumor_hidden_planet>>
    <<stop>>
-> Strip Engine for Parts #line:hollow_moon_engine_choice_02
    <<give_item item_vanguard_thruster 1>>
    <<stop>>
===

